    {
      "number": 1,
      "stem": "The room is dark. Please ____ the light so that we can read.",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "turn off"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "put away"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "turn on"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "C",
      "rationale": "为了在暗房读书需开灯，turn on为开；turn off关灯方向相反；put away收存不等于开启灯。"
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "stem": "The train leaves at 10:20 and arrives at 11:00 on the same morning. It leaves ____ ten twenty and takes ____ minutes.",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "at, forty"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "in, forty"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "at, eighty"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "rationale": "钟点用at；同日上午10:20至11:00为40分钟。B介词错；C计算错。两处条件共同决定一次选择，不拆为两回应。"
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "stem": "I am Ben. This cap belongs to me. My brother has a different cap. This one is ____, not ____.",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "my, his"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "mine, him"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "mine, his"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "C",
      "rationale": "Ben陈述帽子属于自己，独立表语mine；兄弟的独立所属his。A my缺名词；B him为宾格不表示所属。两空一响应且所有权明示。"
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "stem": "Tomorrow is our class photo day. We ____ ready at nine tomorrow morning.",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "were"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "will be"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "will have"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "rationale": "明示明天九点，将来形容词表语用will be ready；were为过去，will have后不能直接以ready补成此谓语。"
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "stem": "—I cannot carry this big box. Can you help me, please?\n—____.",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "Of course. Let me carry it with you"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "I am twelve years old"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "It is under the desk"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "rationale": "A明确同意并协助搬箱；B报年龄，C报位置都不回应求助。未借未用选项排除。"
    }
  ],
